flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> A[Member searches for a book]
    A --> B[View book details and availability]
    B --> C{Copies available?}
    C -- No --> D[Member places a reservation]
    D --> E[Member added to reservation queue]
    E --> Z([End])
    C -- Yes --> F[Member submits borrow request]
    F --> G{Member eligible?<br/>No unpaid fines,<br/>under 3 active loans}
    G -- No --> H[Request rejected with reason]
    H --> Z
    G -- Yes --> I[Librarian reviews the request]
    I --> J{Librarian confirms?}
    J -- No --> H
    J -- Yes --> K[System records loan:<br/>borrow date and due date]
    K --> L[Copy marked On Loan]
    L --> M[Member borrows the book]
    M --> N[Member initiates return]
    N --> O[Librarian processes the return]
    O --> P{Returned after due date?}
    P -- Yes --> Q[System calculates fine:<br/>5 EGP per overdue day]
    Q --> R[Fine added to member account]
    P -- No --> S[No fine]
    R --> T[Copy marked Available]
    S --> T
    T --> U{Reservation queue<br/>waiting?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Notify next member in queue]
    U -- No --> Z
    V --> Z
